    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "결국 본인한테 의지하게 만드는",
      "en": "Until the person depended entirely on them."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 가스라이팅이래",
      "en": "That's why it's called gaslighting."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "라이팅이 이름이였나",
      "en": "Was 'Lighting' the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "거기까진 몰라",
      "en": "I'm not sure about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "주워들은거라",
      "en": "It's just something I heard."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
