      "en": "You're right. I looked it up and apparently there was a 1938 play called *Gas Light* with that story."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 맞아 연극 내용이였오",
      "en": "Oh right! It was from a play."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 주변을 어둡게 만들겠다는건 아니구",
      "en": "I'm not saying I'd make your surroundings dark."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나만 보이지않아? 너한텐 나밖에 없지않아?",
      "en": "\"Don't you only see me? Isn't there only me for you?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이렇게 ㅋ",
      "en": "Like that. ㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "장난이구",
      "en": "I'm kidding."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나한테는",
      "en": "For me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "밖에 없으니까",
      "en": "There's no one else."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너바께",
      "en": "Only you."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "육스라이팅 당한건가",
      "en": "Maybe I've been 'Yuks-lighted.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어감이 그렇다고? ㅋㅎㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
